                                                "sense_id": "c3ba8011-ab7b-3fa8-bcff-59168b5c25e4",
                                                "text": "You know, the kind of guy who would, if he wasn't gay, probably be shouting ‘Oi, gay boy!’ or ‘You bummer!’ or even ‘Oi, paki!’ or what have you. They're not enlightened."
